    {
      "id": "instructions",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "A: Raise paced barrier. The priority-20 shield spends up to 2 stamina before priority-10 softening halves remaining damage. It has 3 charges, one activation per turn and skips the next round after firing. Actions refund 2 stamina once per turn: queue several actions to see the limit. Reapplying does not refill shield charges. B resolves. Inspect priority, remaining charges and blocked cooldown/per-turn activations in the simulator trace.",
      "placement": {
        "row": 1,
        "column": 10,
        "rowSpan": 6,
        "columnSpan": 3
      }
    },
